{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_013_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4394933e8b7f558c8938261657bf0cf8ef489d21e0f8abf7c5e45aad54518636",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7a6b10c255a5576bf57bdcea567c41a1943ad9bc68316aff57cceeb228417aa",
      "text": "（不想让悠介先生知道？\n和悠介先生之间发生了什么事吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c74c7e0574e7a5fd9a48f0acdf2083902fbd7995aa91f9760a5cf434c818c1b2",
      "text": "监督，一脸严肃地怎么啦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecb8be433edfa50698f27fa3bbfe0040e0fd5323e589a1504256f03e8ef17520",
      "text": "……啊！\n难道说，让监督误会了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f72b65acda13ed8180b243dbc2bd3cce81051ce7dda4b47a19376d6cc947e6c7",
      "text": "用那种方式开场，难怪会误会呢！？\n对不起！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4413105c364b5ff21392780a60720ff8fd84adf3e8e13c5e49ee5e8104619fa4",
      "text": "我们的生日不是快到了嘛？我想跟你商量一下\n送给悠介的礼物，所以才叫你出来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a77899fa1641e03cba6a4444527a1824e8eada89da492bc47ac61a83b3bb9ed9",
      "text": "身边的人都问遍了，\n要是自己想的话又容易选出和悠介一模一样的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b94404761240f73a92f00ea1e04c170dbf777647cdb6fc2f564cf5913bb5eded",
      "text": "能依靠的就只有监督了。拜托啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8445089c0c49c1af13b71185776e85736fbbb43268ff6f720ca950e8cb4e13d",
      "text": "原来是生日礼物的事啊。\n要是这件事的话就交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_013kys_01_1_2_013_01:1_2_013_01_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec523d992d2070f6769673ff9477a1e1cfd713e6ef407c4ad94d71a250850efd",
      "text": "谢谢你，监督！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
